PacketPal is a friendly front-end that drives Wireshark's command-line engine
(tshark / dumpcap). Wireshark is a separate work, licensed under GPL-2.0, and
is not included in or modified by this project — PacketPal simply runs it as an
external program. Wireshark is a registered trademark of the Wireshark
Foundation; this project is not affiliated with or endorsed by it.
